.TH QODE-REMOVE-LSP 1 "" "qode" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qode\-remove\-lsp \- list or remove the language servers used by QODE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qode\-remove\-lsp
[\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-\-kotlin\fR] [\fB\-\-cpp\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-y\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows or removes the Kotlin language server that QODE downloaded (~/.local/share/QODE/lsp/kotlin, its caches
and the ~/.local/bin/kotlin-lsp link) and the C/C++ language server clangd (with
.B sudo apt remove
and
.BR "apt autoremove" ).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-list
Show what is installed (default).
.TP
.B \-\-kotlin
Remove the Kotlin language server.
.TP
.B \-\-cpp
Remove clangd.
.TP
.B \-\-all
Both.
.TP
.B \-y, \-\-yes
Do not ask for confirmation.
